  <title type="text">The significance of using Chinese instead of English as the interface of LISP for human</title>
  <link rel="alternate" href="https://yanyingwang.github.io/2022/10/the-significance-of-using-chinese-instead-of-english-as-the-interface-of-lisp-for-human.html?utm_source=programming&amp;utm_medium=Atom" />
