   <name>Yanying Wang</name></author>
  <content type="html">
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="Smaller"&gt;&amp;#26356;&amp;#26032;&amp;#20110;&amp;#65306;2022-10-13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In recent few months, as a result of my thought and inspiration over the last two years, I scratched out the &lt;a href="http://www.yanying.wang/ming"&gt;Ming Programing Language&lt;/a&gt;, which is basically a dialect PL of Racket that I translated parts of its keyword names to Chinese.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://yanyingwang.github.io/2022/10/the-significance-of-using-chinese-instead-of-english-as-the-interface-of-lisp-for-human.html?utm_source=programming&amp;amp;utm_medium=Atom"&gt;&lt;em&gt;More&amp;hellip;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</content></entry>
